The '''Floating Turtle''' is an [[Locations|Island]] for players [[Levels]] 1775-1975. 

The '''Floating Turtle''' is a large island built upon the back of a massive turtle-shaped structure. The island features dense greenery, including numerous [[trees]], as well as several large architectural structures. At the front of the island, the turtle’s head can be seen emerging from the surrounding waters.

A long stone wall circles the island’s perimeter near the edges of the turtle’s back. The Floating Turtle is the largest island in the [[Third Sea]] and the second largest location in the game overall.

Due to its accessibility and central position, the island is one of the most populated areas among players. It is considered as a hub by a lot of players, especially bounty hunters, making it a popular location for [[PvP mechanics|PvP]].

