==Notes==
* Grinding at the Floating Turtle can be extremely difficult, due to this island being a common place for bounty/honor hunters to fight. In case the player is grinding on the Floating Turtle at Lv. 1775 to 1950, it is highly recommended that they purchase or use a [[Private Servers|Private Server]].
* The [[Hungry Man Quest]] can be started at the Floating Turtle, which when completed, gives the player [[Instinct V2]].
* The [[Crypt Master]] is located on Floating Turtle, which is used to start the [[Cursed Dual Katana/Puzzle|Cursed Dual Katana puzzle]] and obtain the [[Cursed Dual Katana]].
* The ''apple'' for the [[Hungry Man Quest]] can be found on top of a hill near the Hungry Man.
* The [[Aura]] color, {{Aura Color|Rainbow Saviour}}, can be unlocked if the player completes the ''[[Horned Man]]'' [[Quests|quest]].
** The Horned Man is located in a large tree in the middle of the Floating Turtle.
** The [[Titles|title]]: '''Final Hero''' is obtained by completing this quest.
** The player can start this quest if they are Lv. 1500; despite the player needing to be at least Lv. 1950 to enter Beautiful Pirate's Domain, it's possible to complete the quest without being Lv. 1950 or above. A video that can show how to enter Beautiful Pirate's Domain without being Lv. 1950 or above will be right [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HgfiEfVrhFU here] (The video is a bit outdated, but it still works).
* The player can upgrade ''[[Electric]]'' to ''[[Electric Claw]]'' by completing the quest of the [[Previous Hero]].
* The player can obtain [[Godhuman]] from the [[Ancient Monk]] if they have reached the needed requirements.

