==Trivia==
* Floating Turtle is the largest island in [[Third Sea]] and the second largest island in the whole game, behind [[Kingdom of Rose]].
* Floating Turtle has the highest number of [[Elite Pirates|Elite Pirate]] spawn locations, with about seven locations.
* Floating Turtle Island also bears the [[Mansion (Third Sea)|Mansion]], a crucial building in the [[Third Sea]] as it holds important [[NPCs|NPC's]] like [[Blox Fruit Gacha]] and one of the four [[Portals]] in the [[Third Sea]].
* Until [[Updates/24|Update 24]], The player could fly through [[Hoops]] to change their appearance if they were using [[Dragon]].
* The Floating Turtle has the highest number of [[bosses]] in the game, having four.
* [[Castle on the Sea|Castle on the sea]], [[Haunted Castle]] and Floating turtle all have the exact same Music.

